    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='E-pharmacy methodology and definitions'>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_3' value='top' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_5' value='top' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='1100' maxwidth='1500' minheight='1100' minwidth='1500' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='6000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98934' x='533' y='727'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='20'>E-PHARMACY | PROJECT METHODOLOGY &amp; DEFINITIONS</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='92546' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98934' x='533' y='6727'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>PROJECT OVERVIEW</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>This project analyses medicine listings from multiple Indian pharmaceutical datasets to assess data quality, product consistency, pricing variations, and potential anomalies.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>The analysis follows a structured process of data profiling, standardisation, validation, cross-source reconciliation, and pricing analytics using MySQL and Tableau.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>DATA SOURCES</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>The project uses three medicine datasets:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>A-Z Medicine Dataset of India</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> – Medicine names, prices, manufacturers, compositions, pack sizes and discontinuation status.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>250K Medicines Dataset</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> – Medicine details, therapeutic classes, chemical classes, usage information and substitutes.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Indian Medicine Data (IMD)</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> – Additional medicine records used for cross-source comparison and reconciliation.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>DATA PREPARATION &amp; QUALITY CHECKS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>The datasets were processed through the following stages:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Data Profiling:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Examined record counts, column structures, missing values and data distributions.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Data Standardisation:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Standardised medicine names, manufacturer names, and relevant text fields.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Data Validation:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Checked missing values, invalid prices, duplicate records and inconsistent product information.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Data Cleaning:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Identified and addressed data-quality issues while retaining the original raw datasets.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Cross-Source Reconciliation:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Compared medicine records across datasets using standardised matching keys.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Pricing Analysis:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Examined price differences, unit-price variations and potential price-pack anomalies.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>KEY BUSINESS METRICS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Clean Medicine Records:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Number of records retained after data-quality checks.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>250K Match Rate:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Percentage of records successfully matched between the relevant datasets.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Price Gap Review:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Number of matched records flagged for price-gap investigation.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Average Price Gap:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Average absolute price difference between matched records.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Price-Pack Anomalies:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Products identified for further investigation due to unusual unit-price variation.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Discontinuation Rate:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Percentage of medicine listings marked as discontinued.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>TOOLS &amp; TECHNOLOGIES</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>MySQL 8.0:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Data import, profiling, cleaning, validation, reconciliation, pricing analysis and SQL-based analytics.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Tableau:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Interactive dashboards, KPI visualisation and business insights.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Microsoft Excel:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'> Initial data inspection and CSV preparation.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>LIMITATIONS &amp; INTERPRETATION</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Dataset records may contain incomplete or inconsistent product information.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Matching records across sources does not guarantee that all product attributes are identical.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Price differences may arise from pack sizes, manufacturers, product variants or source differences.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Price-pack anomalies are indicators for further investigation, not confirmed pricing errors.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Findings reflect the datasets available for this project and should not be interpreted as live market prices.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
